{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1001", "sample_idx": 21, "model_name": "mistralai/mistral-small-4-119b-2603", "content": "**A Midsummer’s Journey in Nippon’s Land**\n\n**Act I: Scene I – The Arrival in Edo’s Grand Bower**\nUpon thy first footfall in the Land of the Rising Sun thou shalt tread the sacred soil of Tokyo’s airy port. There let thy stay be brief yet sweet for one day’s span. Wander through the bustling lanes of Shibuya where lights do dance like fireflies in revelry. Ascend the towering spire of Tokyo Skyscrape to spy the city’s heart below. In the eve repair to the Imperial Palace’s verdant grounds where whispers of history linger in the twilight air.\n\n**Act I: Scene II – The Ancient Capital’s Siren Song**\nWith dawn’s first blush take swift passage to Kyoto the cradle of old Japan. Three nights thou shalt tarry in this hallowed ground. By day gaze upon the golden shrine of Kinkaku-ji where sunlight doth kiss its gilded face. Wander the bamboo grove of Arashiyama where emerald stalks sway like courtiers in a stately dance. At night let thy spirit be enchanted by the geisha’s subtle art in the teahouses of Gion.\n\n**Act II: Scene I – The Way of the Warrior in Nara’s Past**\nFrom Kyoto’s embrace ride forth to Nara the ancient seat of emperors. Spend a day in quiet awe before the colossal Buddha of Tōdai-ji its grandeur humbling all who behold. Let the sacred deer that roam its precincts be thy guides through history’s embrace.\n\n**Act III: Scene I – The Floating World of Osaka’s Mirth**\nWith haste betake thyself to Osaka the merchant’s delight. Two days here thou shalt revel in its mirth. Scale the mighty castle of Osaka where samurai once plotted in shadows deep. Feast upon takoyaki’s savory treasures in Dotonbori’s vibrant bazaar. Let the neon’s glow paint thy dreams as thou wanderest through the night’s embrace.\n\n**Act IV: Scene I – The Hot Springs’ Healing Embrace in Hakone’s Vale**\nFrom Osaka’s tumult flee to Hakone’s tranquil glen. Two days here let thy soul be soothed by nature’s balm. Bathe in the steaming waters of an onsen where mortal cares dissolve like mist before the sun. Gaze upon Mount Fuji’s majestic crown from the lake’s glassy face and know the peace of heaven’s own hand.\n\n**Act V: Scene I – The Farewell’s Soft Echo**\nAs thy journey’s end doth near return to Tokyo’s embrace. Spend thy final night in the city’s heart. Perchance last rites pay at the Meiji Shrine where kami and mortal souls do meet. In the quietude of the eve let thy heart be full and thy spirit light as thou preparest to depart from this fair land.\n\n**Epilogue**\nThus endeth thy sojourn in Nippon’s realm a tale of wonder and delight. May the gods of old Japan smile upon thy path and guide thee safely home. Fare thee well gentle traveler until our next encounter in some far-off land.", "logprobs": [{"token": "**", "logprob": -0.9537896513938904}, {"token": "A", "logprob": -0.048343610018491745}, {"token": " M", "logprob": -1.073288917541504}, {"token": "ids", "logprob": -0.07496730238199234}, {"token": "ummer", "logprob": -0.00018618757894728333}, {"token": "’s", "logprob": -0.07029831409454346}, {"token": " Journey", "logprob": -0.578835666179657}, {"token": " in", "logprob": -1.5993244647979736}, {"token": " Nippon", "logprob": -0.17940595746040344}, {"token": "’s", "logprob": -0.0076560406014323235}, {"token": " Land", "logprob": -1.664612054824829}, {"token": "**\n\n", "logprob": -0.16045604646205902}, {"token": "**", "logprob": -0.3417914807796478}, {"token": "Act", "logprob": -0.14106056094169617}, {"token": " I", "logprob": -0.08182764053344727}, {"token": ":", "logprob": -0.17841194570064545}, {"token": " Scene", "logprob": -1.2109243869781494}, {"token": " I", "logprob": -0.28303736448287964}, {"token": " –", "logprob": -0.05994324013590813}, {"token": " The", "logprob": -0.3721628189086914}, {"token": " Arr", "logprob": -2.3583409786224365}, {"token": "ival", "logprob": -0.0024835001677274704}, {"token": "